OL,4,CUS announces new tariff proposals on   
OL,5,CEU, China, and other trade partners    
OL,6,FThis latest move by the US comes after 
OL,7,Fthe Supreme Court ruled this year that 
OL,8,Fprevious tariffs imposed by Trump were 
OL,9,Fillegally enacted.                     
